[{"field_about_portal":"\u003Ch2 style=\u0022font-family:\u0027Oswald\u0027;font-size:40px;margin-top:5px;\u0022\u003EAbout the Portal\u003C\/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u00a0\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp style=\u0022font-size:25px;line-height:1.25em;\u0022\u003E\u003Cimg style=\u0022float:right;\u0022 src=\u0022\/\/kp4cd.org\/sites\/default\/files\/inline-images\/data_icon4.png\u0022 width=\u0022200\u0022 \/\u003EThe Common Metabolic Diseases Knowledge Portal aggregates, analyzes, and displays human genetic and functional genomic information linked to common metabolic diseases and traits, while protecting the integrity and confidentiality of the underlying data.\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u00a0\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Chr \/\u003E\u003Cp style=\u0022font-size:25px;line-height:1.25em;\u0022\u003E\u003Cimg style=\u0022float:left;\u0022 src=\u0022\/\/kp4cd.org\/sites\/default\/files\/images\/cmdga_logo_2024.png\u0022 width=\u0022200\u0022 \/\u003EView complementary data at the \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/cmdga.org\/\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003ECommon Metabolic Diseases\u00a0\u003C\/a\u003E\u003Cbr \/\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/cmdga.org\/\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EGenome Atlas\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Chr \/\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u00a0\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Ch4 class=\u0022header\u0022 style=\u0022font-family:\u0027Oswald\u0027;font-size:30px;\u0022\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022\/\/kp4cd.org\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022title\u0022\u003EOther knowledge portals in network\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/h4\u003E\u003Cul style=\u0022display:block;list-style:none;padding:0;\u0022\u003E\u003Cli style=\u0022display:inline-block;margin-bottom:10px;\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg style=\u0022height:80px;margin-right:15px;\u0022 src=\u0022\/\/kp4cd.org\/sites\/default\/files\/images\/a2fkp_for_noel.png\u0022 width=\u002280\u0022 align=\u0022left\u0022 \/\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Ch5 style=\u0022white-space:nowrap;\u0022\u003EAssociation to Function Knowledge Portal\u003C\/h5\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/a2f.hugeamp.org\/\u0022\u003EVisit portal\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\u003C\/div\u003E\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli style=\u0022display:inline-block;margin-bottom:10px;margin-right:50px;\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg style=\u0022height:80px;margin-right:15px;\u0022 src=\u0022\/\/kp4cd.org\/sites\/default\/files\/images\/matkplll.png\u0022 width=\u002280\u0022 align=\u0022left\u0022 \/\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Ch5 style=\u0022white-space:nowrap;\u0022\u003EMammalian Adipose Tissue Knowledge Portal\u003C\/h5\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/matkp.org\/\u0022\u003EVisit portal\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\u003C\/div\u003E\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli style=\u0022display:inline-block;margin-bottom:10px;\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg style=\u0022height:80px;margin-right:15px;\u0022 src=\u0022\/\/kp4cd.org\/sites\/default\/files\/images\/cfde_kc_logo.png\u0022 width=\u002280\u0022 align=\u0022left\u0022 \/\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Ch5 style=\u0022white-space:nowrap;\u0022\u003ECommon Fund Data Ecosystem Knowledge Center\u003C\/h5\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/cfdeknowledge.org\/r\/kc_landing\u0022\u003EVisit portal\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\u003C\/div\u003E\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli style=\u0022display:contents;\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg style=\u0022height:80px;margin-right:15px;\u0022 src=\u0022\/\/kp4cd.org\/sites\/default\/files\/images\/KPN_logo_circle.png\u0022 width=\u002280\u0022 align=\u0022left\u0022 \/\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Ch5\u003EKnowledge Portal Network\u003C\/h5\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/kpn4cd.org\u0022\u003EVisit home page\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\u003C\/div\u003E\u003C\/li\u003E\u003C\/ul\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u00a0\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Ch2 style=\u0022font-family:\u0027Oswald\u0027;font-size:30px;margin-top:5px;\u0022\u003EAbout the project\u003C\/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe CMDKP\u00a0includes genetic, epigenomic, and computational results for multiple diseases and traits. Click \u0022Disease-specific portals\u0022 above to select a focused view of results for cardiovascular disease, cerebrovascular disease, type 1 or type 2 diabetes, or sleep disorders. The RRID of the CMDKP is \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/scicrunch.org\/resources\/data\/record\/nlx_144509-1\/SCR_020937\/resolver?q=scr_003743\u0026amp;l=scr_003743\u0026amp;i=rrid:scr_020937\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003ESCR_020937\u003C\/a\u003E.\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe CMDKP is being developed by a team of scientists and software engineers at the Broad Institute, University of Michigan, University of California at San Diego, European Bioinformatics Institute, and many other collaborators as part of a worldwide scientific consortium with contributors from academia, industry, and non-profit organizations.\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/fnih.org\/our-programs\/amp\/accelerating-medicines-common-metabolic-diseases\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EAMP CMD Consortium\u003C\/a\u003E is a collaboration among the following organizations, which also provide funding and\/or governance:\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Ctable style=\u0022margin-top:-20px;\u0022\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cimg src=\u0022https:\/\/kp4cd.org\/sites\/default\/files\/organizations\/nih_2021.png\u0022 width=\u0022167\u0022 height=\u002274\u0022 loading=\u0022lazy\u0022 \/\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cimg src=\u0022https:\/\/kp4cd.org\/sites\/default\/files\/organizations\/fnih_2021.png\u0022 width=\u0022147\u0022 height=\u002274\u0022 loading=\u0022lazy\u0022 \/\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cimg src=\u0022https:\/\/kp4cd.org\/sites\/default\/files\/organizations\/amgen_2021.png\u0022 width=\u0022151\u0022 height=\u002274\u0022 loading=\u0022lazy\u0022 \/\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cimg src=\u0022https:\/\/kp4cd.org\/sites\/default\/files\/organizations\/lilly_2021.png\u0022 width=\u0022167\u0022 height=\u0022108\u0022 loading=\u0022lazy\u0022 \/\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cimg src=\u0022https:\/\/kp4cd.org\/sites\/default\/files\/organizations\/nordisk_2021.png\u0022 width=\u0022146\u0022 height=\u0022108\u0022 loading=\u0022lazy\u0022 \/\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cimg src=\u0022https:\/\/kp4cd.org\/sites\/default\/files\/organizations\/pfizer_2021.png\u0022 width=\u0022151\u0022 height=\u0022108\u0022 loading=\u0022lazy\u0022 \/\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003C\/tbody\u003E\u003C\/table\u003E","field_about_project":"\u003Ch2 style=\u0022font-family:\u0026apos;Oswald\u0026apos;;font-size:30px;margin-top:5px;\u0022\u003EGetting started\u003C\/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAre you interested in what human genetics can tell you about your favorite gene, but not sure where to start in the CMDKP? We\u0027ve outlined a workflow that can help you assess the weight of genetic evidence for involvement of a gene in a biological process. See the workflow in a \u003Ca href=\u0022\/help.html?page=951\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003Estep-by-step guide\u003C\/a\u003E or in this brief \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/youtu.be\/sKVXebGzf4g\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003Evideo\u003C\/a\u003E. Watch this \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/youtu.be\/4nB1on--hvQ\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003E1-minute video\u003C\/a\u003E for an overview of the CMDKP.\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca style=\u0022background-color:#0299c6;border-radius:3px;color:#fff !important;display:block;font-family:sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:17px;padding:5px 10px;\u0022 href=\u0022\/r\/peg_standards\u0022\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELearn standards and infrastructure for predicted effector gene matrices and lists \u0026gt;\u0026gt;\u003C\/strong\u003E\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Ch2 style=\u0022font-family:\u0026apos;Oswald\u0026apos;;font-size:30px;margin-top:5px;\u0022\u003EWhat\u0027s new\u003C\/h2\u003E","field_tagline":"Providing data and tools to promote understanding and treatment of common metabolic diseases","field_banner_logo":"cmdkp_header_logo_2024_2.svg","field_front_logo":"cmdkp_front_logo_2024_2.svg","field_under_dataset_plots":""}]